OL,3,CFour deaths at homeless shelter linked
OL,4,Cto serial killer under police review
OL,6,FA review is being conducted into the
OL,7,Fdeaths of four people who were living
OL,8,Fat a homeless shelter at the same time
OL,9,Fas serial killer James Desborough,
OL,10,Fpolice have said.
OL,12,FDesborough, 40, is to be sentenced on
OL,13,FWednesday afternoon for murdering
OL,14,FClaudio Aquilino, 57, and Daniel
OL,15,FColeman, 43, in Cornwall last year.
OL,17,FThe killer and his victims previously
OL,18,Flived together at Sandy Lodge Hotel in
OL,19,FNewquay, which housed homeless people
OL,20,Fand those suffering from addictions.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
