OL,3,CFour deaths at homeless shelter linked
OL,4,Cto serial killer under police review
OL,6,FIn light of the deaths of Mr Aquilino
OL,7,Fand Mr Coleman, police are reviewing
OL,8,Fthe unexplained deaths of four others
OL,9,Fwho lived there at the same time as
OL,10,FDesborough.
OL,12,FThe killer lived at Sandy Lodge Hotel
OL,13,Fbetween December 2024 and April 2025,
OL,14,Fduring which time two men and two
OL,15,Fwomen died unexpectedly.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
