PN,40303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785395896
OL,3,CFour deaths at homeless shelter linked
OL,4,Cto serial killer under police review
OL,6,FDetective Superintendent Rachael
OL,7,FBentley, of Devon and Cornwall Police,
OL,8,Fsaid: "As a major crime investigation
OL,9,Fteam, we were informed by the
OL,10,Fcoroner's officer for His Majesty's
OL,11,FCoroner that there were four deaths at
OL,12,FSandy Lodge.
OL,14,F"As part of the investigation, a
OL,15,Fdetective inspector, separate to the
OL,16,Finvestigation but within major crime,
OL,17,Fdid a review of those deaths and that
OL,18,Fincluded commissioning some more
OL,19,Fforensic work, some CCTV and
OL,20,Fstatements.
OL,26,@pD@GOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
