OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785395896
OL,3,CFour deaths at homeless shelter linked
OL,4,Cto serial killer under police review
OL,6,F"There are still some inquiries
OL,7,Foutstanding on those.
OL,9,F"They remain as unexpected deaths, but
OL,10,Fthere are still some inquiries
OL,11,Foutstanding. He's not a suspect at
OL,12,Fthis time.
OL,14,F"We're in conversation with His
OL,15,FMajesty's Coroner, but they were
OL,16,Freviewed as part of the investigation."
OL,18,FShe added that the investigation into
OL,19,Fthe four deaths at the Sandy Lodge
OL,20,FHotel was "ongoing".
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@AOUvD@AOUxD@gO]|D@KOU|D@SO]
